microtel provides CMake targets:

    find_package(microtel CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE microtel::microtel)

  microtel finds nghttp2 through pkg-config, so a pkg-config executable must
  be on PATH (or PKG_CONFIG_EXECUTABLE set) when your project configures.

  With the "leaf" feature, the C leaf library is also available:

    target_link_libraries(firmware PRIVATE microtel::leaf)

  The operator tool is installed as tools/microtel/microtel-preflight.
